    <string name="push_manual_body">TrueCtrl can do this for you when your user has the Alert Write role. Otherwise, in the TrueNAS web UI:\n1. Open System › Alert Settings and add an alert service.\n2. Name: TrueCtrl. Type: Slack. Webhook URL: the push address above (tap it to copy).\n3. Level: Warning, then Send Test Alert and Save.\nTrueNAS has no ntfy type, but its Slack type sends each alert as a small JSON message that TrueCtrl understands.</string>
    <string name="push_dedupe_note">While push is on, TrueNAS alerts arrive by push, so the background check doesn\'t notify about them twice. Treat the push address like a password: anyone who has it can send you notifications.</string>
